        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***TWO BED / PRIME LOCATION / DESIGNATED PARKING / TURNKEY / OPEN-PLAN LIVING DESIGN / GFCH / EXCELLENT TRANSPORT LINKS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are immensely proud to bring to the market Apartment 3, College View, All Hallows Green. This ground floor, two-bedroom apartment enjoys an exclusive position in All Hallows Green overlooking the spectacular grounds of All Hallows College. \r\n\r\nIt is ideally situated in a quiet, private development just off Griffith Avenue with pedestrian access from Church Avenue in Drumcondra Village. This attractive, light-filled apartment is spacious and modern, yet warm and welcoming accommodation in this fantastic tranquil setting. \r\n\r\nThe property is presented in turnkey condition throughout. The entrance hall features both a useful storage cupboard and a large airing cupboard and leads into a fantastic spacious open-plan living and kitchen area. The kitchen is fully equipped and comes with all modern appliances one would expect to find in such an exclusive property. The kitchen design is both stylish and contemporary featuring cream cabinetry, black countertop and tiled flooring and splashback.\r\n\r\nThe living space is an excellent size and features elegant ceiling coving and fireplace with stove-effect fire. Generously proportioned French doors open onto a patio and green space. \r\n\r\nThe two bedrooms are an excellent size and both overlook green spaces. Both bedrooms have built-in wardrobes. A fully beige-tiled bathroom with bath completes the internal accommodation.\r\n\r\nThis apartment comes with a designated car space just to the front and there is also access within the grounds to a bicycle storage area. \r\n\r\nThis property offers so much and will appeal to first time buyers, investors or someone looking to downsize. With stunning views and an enviable Dublin 9 location, it must be viewed to be truly appreciated.\r\n\r\nAll Hallows Green is a tranquil, private development built on a mature wooded site on part of the original grounds of All Hallows College. A vast selection of amenities are right on the doorstep including numerous eateries, shops, bars, hotels, schools and colleges.\r\n\r\nFor the sports enthusiast, Croke Park, SportsLink and Morton Stadium are all only a short distance away. The City Centre is within walking distance and commuters are very well catered for with several bus routes, Aircoach and Drumcondra train station serving the locale. Close proximity to the M1 & M50 is a further feature.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
